      "originalText": "NOTES",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xglPxGKohhdIuWM0_QAbs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 434.30269628515634,
      "y": 614.08879,
      "width": 553.1795654296875,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ab",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 352034676,
      "version": 733,
      "versionNonce": 1116331636,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792682138787,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scope = the threads that share the barrier;\na collection of threads involved in a barrier.\n\nThreads reach the barrier at different times; nobody\npasses until the last one arrives.\n\nUse: phase 1 writes something all threads need (e.g. into\nshared memory); phase 2 reads it.\n\nThe barrier guarantees phase 1 is finished everywhere\nbefore phase 2 starts anywhere.\n\nThreads in different blocks never share a barrier; blocks\ncannot wait for each other.\n\nEarly finishers idle; the slowest thread sets the pace.\nKeeps phases balanced. \n\nTerminology: arrive at the barrier, released\nfrom the barrier, scope.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scope = the threads that share the barrier;\na collection of threads involved in a barrier.\n\nThreads reach the barrier at different times; nobody\npasses until the last one arrives.\n\nUse: phase 1 writes something all threads need (e.g. into\nshared memory); phase 2 reads it.\n\nThe barrier guarantees phase 1 is finished everywhere\nbefore phase 2 starts anywhere.\n\nThreads in different blocks never share a barrier; blocks\ncannot wait for each other.\n\nEarly finishers idle; the slowest thread sets the pace.\nKeeps phases balanced. \n\nTerminology: arrive at the barrier, released\nfrom the barrier, scope.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
